  m_Text: 'Left click selects the evidence under the pointer. Solid walls and floors
    block the ray.

    F inspects the selection and marks it discovered.

    T,
    or Tag Evidence, places one marker at the yellow crosshair.

    WASD moves.
    Q and E move down and up. Shift moves faster.

    Hold the right mouse button
    to look. Esc ends the session and closes the log.'
